{"reviewId": "64720176_8apJKEPAf", "review": {"abstract": "2019年房价会是一个低点，2017年、2018年房价会回落。一个房地产周期的循环就是这样，20年的循环，15年上升，5年下降，美国也是一样。2007年美国房价开始下跌，跌到2011年左右触底反", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterUid": 23, "content": "如果真是这样，我手上的房子现在卖掉意义也不是很大了，快到底了。北京的房子再怎么说也不会跌得那么厉害吧", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "author": {"userVid": 64720176, "name": "可南", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0013-FiaBjQBixB~s6OuCOlpf_10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "可南", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "融化内心的冰封大海。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-100", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "5730-5827", "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterName": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "chapterIdx": 23, "reviewId": "64720176_8apJKEPAf", "userVid": 64720176, "topics": [], "createTime": 1783398912, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 0, "likes": [], "commentsCount": 3, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "我也是这样想的。手上目前有一套房子，已经跌了一半了，目前租金比银行利息高，就留着了。和炒股相似，现在卖正是地点割肉的时候，再坚持坚持，毕竟杭州是省会城市", "reviewId": "64720176_8apJKEPAf", "commentId": "64720176_8apJKEPAf_c18108288_8arU64aby", "userVid": 18108288, "createTime": 1783521990, "author": {"userVid": 18108288, "name": "Felicia", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0025-C4t_kt13_emTKClPE6nGqe6/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "Felicia", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241216-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, {"reviewId": "64720176_8apJKEPAf", "content": "主要租金不一定会比银行利息高，毕竟资金比较多的话，银行会有私募之类的。租金还是回报率比较低。", "toUserVid": 18108288, "toCommentId": "64720176_8apJKEPAf_c18108288_8arU64aby", "commentId": "64720176_8apJKEPAf_c64720176_8arVeJSog", "userVid": 64720176, "createTime": 1783523034, "author": {"userVid": 64720176, "name": "可南", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0013-FiaBjQBixB~s6OuCOlpf_10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "可南", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "融化内心的冰封大海。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-100", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 100}}, "replyUser": {"userVid": 18108288, "name": "Felicia", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0025-C4t_kt13_emTKClPE6nGqe6/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "Felicia", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241216-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, {"content": "但是一旦房子涨起来的话，收益远超过银行。而且根据过去15年的经验，如果每次都能顺势而为，听央妈的话，就不至于把房子买在高点。现在深刻体会到，要跟着国家的政策走。。但具体情况，还得自己定投，每个城市每套房子的情况都不一样。", "reviewId": "64720176_8apJKEPAf", "toCommentId": "64720176_8apJKEPAf_c64720176_8arVeJSog", "toUserVid": 64720176, "commentId": "64720176_8apJKEPAf_c18108288_8arVV6nye", "userVid": 18108288, "createTime": 1783523660, "likesCount": 1, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 18108288, "name": "Felicia", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0025-C4t_kt13_emTKClPE6nGqe6/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "Felicia", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241216-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "replyUser": {"userVid": 64720176, "name": "可南", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0013-FiaBjQBixB~s6OuCOlpf_10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "可南", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "融化内心的冰封大海。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-100", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 100}}}], "htmlContent": "如果真是这样，我手上的房子现在卖掉意义也不是很大了，快到底了。北京的房子再怎么说也不会跌得那么厉害吧", "dislikeCount": 0, "synckey": 1786622820}